{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ae433d8be0ea942de01568224d3b905f748df72d399060490000192bb4d1cfd1", "ja": "（今日はスカジで、ファッション誌のインタビュー。\nお気入りの扇子を手に、朋花も機嫌が良さそうだ……）", "zh": "（今天是在《S卡》接受时尚杂志采访。朋花手里拿着心爱的折扇，看起来心情也很不错……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1001_interviewer", "source_sha256": "2ae1834c12cd3558c5afb8d7d8f835f4b258152ebc4273a7e808b6a27abd6cef", "ja": "最後の質問です。今回『BATTLE OF THEATER』\nでもありますが……自信の程はいかがでしょう？", "zh": "最后一个问题。这次也是『BATTLE OF THEATER』的相关内容……您对自己有多少把握呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "055be3c09f9c29d7f3a92553e04f8e06c782a7725eea143c24d07cd5ae4333ac", "ja": "うふふ、愚問ですね～。\n私としては、強要するつもりはありませんが……。", "zh": "呵呵，真是个愚蠢的问题呢～。\n就我而言，虽然并没有强求的打算……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "18b0b65a0de41a30792fcb39d2aba6218587fa2b52c835276870d76e00e92e26", "ja": "みなさんには、ただ己の心に従って、\n勝負に挑んでいただけたら……と思っています～。", "zh": "我希望大家都能遵从自己的内心，勇敢迎接这场胜负……就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1004_interviewer", "source_sha256": "266068fecdf83f9157dd4908fe337e7a4e8c211a72a88c4a84491df241e448bd", "ja": "おお～！　さすが、聖母と呼ばれる天空橋さん。\n寛容な心をお持ちなんですね！", "zh": "哦哦～！不愧是被称为圣母的天空桥小姐。\n您真是拥有一颗宽容的心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "9fe1fa11178e71abea3450d7a9e3f93f38e694a7dce5fd1360451f39e212e254", "ja": "ですが、こうも思っているんですよ～。", "zh": "不过，我也有这样的想法哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "fd054c2ab7ab9e988b5c6eb83c8dc004596239372bc672fc3c0901a77dcb3b21", "ja": "頂点を目指す、ひとりのアイドルとして。\n絶対に、情けない姿を見せるわけにはいかない……と。", "zh": "作为一个以顶点为目标的偶像。\n绝对不能露出丢脸的样子……才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1007_interviewer", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "362b038f58d3fc9d0878870036c5681dd2b3ee537b1f556d56bb20be64c2ab04", "ja": "スカジの本当の魅力は、直接手に取ってみなければ\nわかりません。それは私たちアイドルも同じこと……。", "zh": "斯卡吉真正的魅力，不亲手感受一下是不会明白的。我们偶像也是一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "1d2fe60f68d84a79c6870db93dba6b250728a74bb55096852baaa313e4398374", "ja": "聖母の真意が、気になりますか～？\nでしたら……私たちに会いにお越しください。", "zh": "想知道圣母的真意吗～？\n那么……请来见我们吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "bd60bcb36e79e4cb5f5bf9477a6af76c7359c0d25dc2a7b31980d08e2d457d74", "ja": "みなさんの賢明な判断を信じています～。", "zh": "我相信大家会做出明智的判断的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1011_null", "source_sha256": "62c4edf5b62f4a54bdf167615cf9f551cc597e1441499c6497be336781116cc7", "ja": "インタビュー終了後……", "zh": "采访结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0973db262d148ec9bab5e00b56cee59660ff78782b9387562dbe67c36a58773b", "ja": "お疲れ様、朋花。すごいインタビューだったな……。\n特に最後は……なんか意外だったよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，朋花。真是一场精彩的采访啊……\n尤其是最后……总觉得挺出人意料的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "2b33077f1de5add0615a27c43d681ab9473bb57b549976232254fddd2af1e4b8", "ja": "そうでしょうか～？　私は、\n自分の役割を果たしただけですよ～。", "zh": "是这样吗～？我只是完成了自己的职责而已哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "bc0d1b6daa232a830a85a75f7df9d63e5c66bf118fabcaecfdc033432edd2bd3", "ja": "ブランド同士の対決なら、真さんや歌織さんの\n魅力をアピールすれば十分です。ですが……。", "zh": "如果是品牌之间的对决，只要展现真和歌织的魅力就足够了。但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "bff7c26192f4f5b57f667a43cd3b038c87eea1dcde16557b40b75635edd96427", "ja": "私は『FAIRY MYSTICAL』の名を背負ってます。\nチームに報いるには、使えるものは使わないと。うふ♪", "zh": "我可是背负着『FAIRY MYSTICAL』之名的。\n为了回报团队，能用的手段就都得用上才行。嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e7d92560edbe092d412e76af7fa8956e0218d50707ff65e3fe1802e04d18eb9a", "ja": "な、なるほど……。どちらの勝負も勝つためには、\n手段は問わないということか。", "zh": "原、原来如此……也就是说，为了赢下哪一场较量，都不在乎手段吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1017_p", "source_sha256": "48b1d33280aba70f5d90dfe852a1726d8ff813f98a2ad22c2e2dd2b626b49185", "ja": "朋花の事、少し理解できた気がしていたけど。\nまだまだだったな。", "zh": "我以为自己对朋花有了一点了解……\n\n看来还差得远呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "33c51cecb8c23fd23270c05da0f9470bdd05dbf2649f32a0597b90a59d795996", "ja": "ふふっ。聖母を理解できただなんて……\n生意気ですね～？", "zh": "呵呵。居然敢说自己已经理解圣母了……\n还真是自以为是呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0f778791910584cfc5e08cb2a13f0a8f5250c12d51f7132a0e9122c8691a6662", "ja": "あ、ははっ……そうだな。\nもっと朋花の事を知るために、頑張るよ。", "zh": "啊，哈哈……是啊。为了更加了解朋花，我会努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0693_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "51d25c2864ce2f18773140a1a5296713980093ff17d8871e306a0ff1034fc4b3", "ja": "ええ、精進してください。口約束だけで終わらず、\nきちんと成果が見えるように……期待していますよ～♪", "zh": "嗯，请继续努力。别只停留在口头约定上，要确实拿出看得见的成果……我很期待哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
